I came to Yomonsni with little experience of being authentically myself. Over a number of online sessions, Norm met me where I was at with patient guidance. He has an impressive breadth of knowledge that allows for exploration of many topics.
Discussions were always non judgemental and my emotions were well supported.

A weekend retreat was opportunity to explore further and more deeply.  In person Norm has a reassuring presence that quickly put me at ease. Submission was explored with sensitivity and respect for my boundaries. I am thankful for the way we have worked together to enrich my life and would highly recommend Norm as a coach. 

